## Important Directories

| Directory | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/etc` | Configuration |
| `/var` | Variable data |
| `/home` | User files |
| `/tmp` | Temporary files |
| `/usr` | Programs and libraries |
| `/opt` | Optional software |
| `/dev` | Device files |
| `/proc` | Process/kernel information |
| `/sys` | System/device information |
| `/run` | Runtime data |
| `/boot` | Boot files |

